.TH "waybar\-cava" "5" "2026\-08\-08" "waybar\-cava" "User Manual"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
waybar \- cava module
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The \fBcava\fR module integrates the \fBkarlstav/cava\fR audio visualizer into Waybar.\&
It supports two frontends: a text\-based \fBraw\fR frontend and a GPU\-based \fBGLSL\fR
frontend.\& The active frontend is selected by the \fBmethod\fR option in the
\fB[output]\fR section of the cava configuration file.\&
.PP
.SH FILES
.PP
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/waybar/config 
.br
Per user configuration file
.PP
.SH ADDITIONAL FILES
.PP
libcava lives in:
.PP
.PD 0
.IP 1. 4
/usr/lib/libcava.\&so or /usr/lib64/libcava.\&so
.IP 2. 4
/usr/lib/pkgconfig/cava.\&pc or /usr/lib64/pkgconfig/cava.\&pc
.IP 3. 4
/usr/include/cava
.PD
.PP
