.sp 1
Configuration can be provided in three ways:
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fB\fRCava config only\fB\fR: set \fBcava_config\fR to a cava configuration file and omit all other options.\&
.IP \(bu 4
\fB\fRWaybar JSON only\fB\fR: leave out \fBcava_config\fR and set every option in Waybar'\&s module configuration.\&
.IP \(bu 4
\fB\fRMixed\fB\fR: provide a \fBcava_config\fR and also set specific options in Waybar'\&s JSON.\& Waybar reads the file first, then overrides any values present in the JSON.\&
.PD
.PP
